<title>GREECE: TABLE-GREEK/BUND GAP SHRINKS TO 397 BPS,301 VS BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GREEK/BUND GAP SHRINKS TO 397 BPS,301 VS BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds narrowed to 397 basis points on Wednesday from Tuesday's 401.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also shrank to 301 basis points from 303 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.67%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.70%	397	401 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.61%	405	408 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.66%	301	303 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.38%	329	331 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.35%	332	338 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.20%	247	249 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.51%	316	321 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
